==Battleground==
*1 [[Kid Tappa]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Kid Tappa]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Kid Tappa]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gobble]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mr. Puffington]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Gobble]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Gobble]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Kid Tappa]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Kid Tappa]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage can be cheesed using [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]]'s wave talent. Allow the first Kid Tappa to connect with the base and start to spawn Dark Lazer, Gobble will not have the reach to hurt Dark Lazer, stacking a few Dark Lazers and connecting waves should kill Gobble in time. Bringing a barrier breaker is not necessary, you can also use [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]] to be a unit blocker as well as break Tappa's weak barrier. Slow beam comes in handy when connecting with the base which allows Dark Lazer to connect with Kid Tappa and create an impenetrable force of waves that stunlocks even Mr. Puffington.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Dawn of the Beginning]] stages except [[Buried Hypocrisy]], Dilemma of Birth's name is the reverse of one from [[Dead End Night]], in this case [[Catharsis' End]] (Dilemma of Birth is an uncertain beginning, Catharsis' End an indubitable conclusion).

